title: Script hidden in invisible characters
severity: medium
score: 25
tags: obfuscation, evasion
attack: T1027, T1027.010
description: A script holds a run of 64 or more invisible characters (Hangul fillers U+3164
  / U+FFA0, zero-width spaces and joiners) mixing at least two of them: a payload written in
  binary with invisible code points and decoded at runtime, as Tycoon 2FA does to hide its
  sign-in page from signature scanners.
---
invisible_code
| where not(exists(final_allowlisted))
